{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-blog-post-js","path":"/algorithm/LEET/L1930UniqueLength3PalindromicSubsequences/","result":{"data":{"markdownRemark":{"frontmatter":{"title":"1930. Unique Length-3 Palindromic Subsequences","date":"January 04, 2025"},"html":"<h1>문제 설명</h1>\n<p>이 문제는 주어진 문자열에서 길이가 3인 Palindromic Subsequences의 개수를 구하는 문제다. 2025년 첫 문제다.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 800px; \"\n    >\n      <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 116.00000000000001%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"1930\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/65a2feda7a0acabfc14a3d59e1aefd04/5a190/1930.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/65a2feda7a0acabfc14a3d59e1aefd04/772e8/1930.png 200w,\n/static/65a2feda7a0acabfc14a3d59e1aefd04/e17e5/1930.png 400w,\n/static/65a2feda7a0acabfc14a3d59e1aefd04/5a190/1930.png 800w,\n/static/65a2feda7a0acabfc14a3d59e1aefd04/18539/1930.png 1074w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n    </span></p>\n<h2>풀이 및 해설</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>투 포인터와 딕셔너리를 이용해서 풀 수 있는 문제다.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>풀이</h2>\n<pre><code class=\"language-python\">class Solution:\n    def countPalindromicSubsequence(self, s: str) -> int:\n        first = {}\n        last = {}\n\n        for i, char in enumerate(s):\n            if char not in first:\n                first[char] = i\n            last[char] = i\n        \n        result = 0\n\n        for char in set(s):\n            if first[char] &#x3C; last[char]:\n                unique = len(set(s[first[char] + 1:last[char]]))\n                result += unique\n        \n        return result\n</code></pre>\n<h2>Complexity Analysis</h2>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 800px; \"\n    >\n      <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 93.5%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"tc\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/1b00bc2ee74de6fc5b6d554019b9385f/5a190/tc.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/1b00bc2ee74de6fc5b6d554019b9385f/772e8/tc.png 200w,\n/static/1b00bc2ee74de6fc5b6d554019b9385f/e17e5/tc.png 400w,\n/static/1b00bc2ee74de6fc5b6d554019b9385f/5a190/tc.png 800w,\n/static/1b00bc2ee74de6fc5b6d554019b9385f/302a4/tc.png 1080w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n    </span></p>\n<h3>시간 복잡도</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>O(N)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>공간 복잡도</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>O(1)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Constraint Analysis</h2>\n<pre><code>Constraints:\n- 3 &#x3C;= s.length &#x3C;= 10^5\n- s consists of only lowercase English letters.\n</code></pre>\n<h1>References</h1>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/unique-length-3-palindromic-subsequences/\">1930. Unique Length-3 Palindromic Subsequences</a></li>\n</ul>"}},"pageContext":{"slug":"/algorithm/LEET/L1930UniqueLength3PalindromicSubsequences/"}},"staticQueryHashes":[],"slicesMap":{}}